cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Larmor, please cite it as below, and also cite the papers of the
  methods you used (https://larmor.org/about/citing/).
type: software
title: "Larmor: a Python library and viewer for diffusion MRI"
abstract: >-
  Larmor is a Python library and command line for diffusion MRI, with a viewer,
  BrainViewer: denoising and Gibbs-ringing removal, DTI and DKI, spherical
  deconvolution, peaks, tractography, tract profiles, track density images and
  structural connectomes.
authors:
  - given-names: Antonio
    family-names: Di Meglio
license: LGPL-3.0-only
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23604584
version: 2.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-23"
url: "https://larmor.org"
repository-code: "https://github.com/larmor-dmri/larmor"
contact:
  - name: Larmor
    email: contact@larmor.org
keywords:
  - diffusion MRI
  - tractography
  - spherical deconvolution
  - DTI
  - DKI
  - neuroimaging
